<title>USA: Cascade agrees to acquire Kenhar.</title>
<headline>Cascade agrees to acquire Kenhar.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cascade Corp and Kenhar Corp said they signed a letter of intent for Cascade to buy all of the outstanding shares of Kenhar for $56.5 million cash and securities exchangeable into 1.1 million Cascade common shares.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to be completed in March 1997, subject to completion of a definitive agreement, due diligence, and regulatory approvals.</p>
